<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets 2-wk rev repo at limit of 14.7pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets 2-wk rev repo at limit of 14.7pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Friday set  a two-week reverse repo tender to drain liquidity with a limit rate  of 14.7 percent, down from 14.9 percent in a similar operation on  Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
